		<name>ImgCraft</name>
		<summary>Unofficial, lightweight Android frontend for Imgur</summary>
		<desc>ImgCraft is an unofficial app for browsing Imgur, built on Imgur's v3 API. It is not
made by, endorsed by or affiliated with Imgur.

* Feed, search, tags, posts, albums, videos and comments
* Favourites in folders, follows and hidden users and tags, kept on the device
* Import favourites, follows, blocked users and muted tags from an Imgur account
* Vote, comment and reply once logged in
* No ads, analytics or Google Play services

ImgCraft comes without an API key: paste the client ID of an Imgur API application in
Settings.</desc>
